271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 760 0 R
/E (Substack: is a more recent player, and this is one I hoped would possibly be able to do something different, given its focus on writing. I am a writer, but my "feed" there has for some reason become random click-bait shit and people shilling how to be "authentic and true to yourself" and "how to get more followers". I have come across some interesting people there, but the signal to noise ratio is still far too low. It seems to be going the way of medium with it's own kind of performance culture that is not quite my style \(picture this: cupcakes and picnics on the riverside instead of anarchy in the streets\)...)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [24 450 0 R 26]
>>
