/P 184 0 R
/E (Most of us learned how money works through the traditional banking system. We open an app, look at a balance, and assume that money exists as a number stored inside an account. When we arrive at Bitcoin, we tend to bring that same mental model with us.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
