/Alt (When you look at a bank account, you see a balance. The bank keeps aninternal ledger and simply increases or decreases a number whenever youmake a transaction. Bitcoin works differently. The network does not storebalances. Instead, it stores pieces of bitcoin called UTXOs \(UnspentTransaction Outputs\), which are transaction outputs that have not yet beenspent.)
